            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Q2: How often should I request a COA from my manufacturer?</h3>
                <p>You should request a COA for every single batch produced. This is your primary defense against
                    quality drift and provides the necessary data for your own internal quality tracking.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Q3: Are these documents required for online sales in India?</h3>
                <p>Yes. Major e-commerce platforms like Amazon and Flipkart require SDS and other compliance
                    documents before listing aerosol products due to their classification as hazardous materials.</p>
            </div>
